{"version":1,"content":"<p>當地時間11月1日中午，一架註冊編號N722BD龐巴迪裏爾60（Learjet 60）中型公務機在美國佛羅裏達州棕櫚灘縣墜毀，機上一共9人全部遇難。目前，<strong>遇難者名單已經對外公佈，其中就包含來自得州奧斯汀的科技企業家亞當·羅賓遜一家四口</strong>。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584850.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:36.301050+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:05:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.047939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.047939+00:00","content_hash":"5b0c7a92acd8da6cf20dcb559ff6b795ef29fded2a99015574a349976128fd28","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}